{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13493","headline":"赋虞书歌 · 贾躭","name":"赋虞书歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆书之中虞书巧，体法自然归大道。\n不同怀素只攻颠，岂类张芝惟创草。\n形势素，筋骨老，父子君臣相揖抱。\n孤青似竹更飕颸，阔白如波长浩渺。\n能方正，不隳倒，功夫未至难寻奥。\n须知孔子庙堂碑，便是青箱中至宝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾躭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}